# Wind in the Pines — the Stand: C Mixolydian (the shared key's), the wind in the strings swelling
# and falling, the pack's call far off on a horn, a flute above the ridge. Original, cb17
# (2026-10-29). 6 bars of 4/4 at 60: 24 s, a loop.
